  "details": "A vulnerability was found in newbee-ltd newbee-mall up to 2.7.5. This impacts an unknown function of the file /jshERP-boot/accountHead/updateAccountHeadAndDetail of the component Shopping Cart Quantity Handler. Performing a manipulation of the argument goodsCount results in business logic errors. The attack can be initiated remotely. The exploit has been made public and could be used. The project was informed of the problem early through an issue report but has not responded yet.",
